WEBVTT

00:00:00.176 --> 00:00:01.046
SORRY.

00:00:01.089 --> 00:00:04.310
THE SORTING CEREMONY
WILL BEGIN MOMENTARILY.

00:00:05.659 --> 00:00:07.270
IT'S TRUE, THEN.

00:00:07.313 --> 00:00:09.794
WHAT THEY'RE SAYING
ON THE TRAIN.

00:00:09.837 --> 00:00:12.057
HARRY POTTER HAS
COME TO HOGWARTS.

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:13.101
[STUDENTS GASP]

00:00:13.145 --> 00:00:14.364
[WHISPERING]
Harry Potter?

00:00:14.407 --> 00:00:17.889
THIS IS CRABBE
AND GOYLE...

00:00:17.932 --> 00:00:20.239
AND I'M MALFOY.

00:00:20.283 --> 00:00:21.893
DRACO MALFOY.

00:00:21.936 --> 00:00:23.634
[SNICKERS]

00:00:24.765 --> 00:00:26.245
THINK MY NAME'S
FUNNY, DO YOU?

00:00:26.289 --> 00:00:28.465
NO NEED
TO ASK YOU YOURS.

00:00:28.508 --> 00:00:31.468
RED HAIR AND
A HAND-ME-DOWN ROBE?

00:00:31.511 --> 00:00:33.731
YOU MUST BE
A WEASLEY.

00:00:34.819 --> 00:00:36.255
YOU'LL SOON FIND OUT

00:00:36.299 --> 00:00:37.561
THAT SOME
WIZARDING FAMILIES

00:00:37.604 --> 00:00:39.040
ARE BETTER THAN
OTHERS, POTTER.

00:00:39.084 --> 00:00:40.955
YOU DON'T WANT
TO GO MAKING FRIENDS

00:00:40.999 --> 00:00:42.914
WITH THE WRONG SORT.

00:00:42.957 --> 00:00:45.264
I CAN HELP YOU
THERE.

00:00:47.701 --> 00:00:49.442
I THINK I CAN TELL
THE WRONG SORT

00:00:49.486 --> 00:00:50.835
FOR MYSELF, THANKS.

00:00:57.624 --> 00:00:58.625
WE'RE READY
FOR YOU NOW.

00:00:58.669 --> 00:00:59.670
FOLLOW ME.

00:01:17.862 --> 00:01:19.298
IT'S NOT REAL,
THE CEILING.

00:01:19.342 --> 00:01:20.691
IT'S JUST BEWITCHED

00:01:20.734 --> 00:01:22.736
TO LOOK LIKE
THE NIGHT SKY.

00:01:22.780 --> 00:01:26.000
I READ ABOUT IT IN
HOGWARTS: A HISTORY.

00:01:38.839 --> 00:01:40.624
ALL RIGHT. WILL YOU WAIT
ALONG HERE, PLEASE?

00:01:42.930 --> 00:01:46.325
NOW, BEFORE WE BEGIN,

00:01:46.369 --> 00:01:48.022
PROFESSOR DUMBLEDORE

00:01:48.066 --> 00:01:49.763
WOULD LIKE
TO SAY A FEW WORDS.

00:01:49.807 --> 00:01:52.288
I HAVE A FEW
START-OF-TERM NOTICES

00:01:52.331 --> 00:01:55.073
I WISH TO ANNOUNCE.

00:01:55.116 --> 00:01:57.205
THE FIRST YEARS,
PLEASE NOTE

00:01:57.249 --> 00:02:00.948
THAT THE DARK FOREST
IS STRICTLY FORBIDDEN

00:02:00.992 --> 00:02:03.168
TO ALL STUDENTS.

00:02:03.211 --> 00:02:06.519
ALSO, OUR CARETAKER,
MR. FILCH,

00:02:06.563 --> 00:02:09.087
HAS ASKED ME
TO REMIND YOU

00:02:09.130 --> 00:02:10.915
THAT THE THIRD-FLOOR
CORRIDOR

00:02:10.958 --> 00:02:14.222
ON THE RIGHT-HAND SIDE
IS OUT OF BOUNDS

00:02:14.266 --> 00:02:16.050
TO EVERYONE
WHO DOES NOT WISH

00:02:16.094 --> 00:02:18.705
TO DIE A MOST
PAINFUL DEATH.

00:02:18.749 --> 00:02:21.273
THANK YOU.

00:02:22.448 --> 00:02:25.364
WHEN I CALL YOUR NAME,

00:02:25.408 --> 00:02:28.802
YOU WILL COME FORTH,
I SHALL PLACE

00:02:28.846 --> 00:02:31.588
THE SORTING HAT
ON YOUR HEAD...

00:02:31.631 --> 00:02:34.808
AND YOU WILL BE SORTED
INTO YOUR HOUSES.

00:02:34.852 --> 00:02:36.767
HERMIONE GRANGER.

00:02:36.810 --> 00:02:37.985
[SIGHS]

00:02:40.031 --> 00:02:41.380
OH, NO.

00:02:41.424 --> 00:02:42.816
OK, RELAX.

00:02:42.860 --> 00:02:45.950
MENTAL, THAT ONE.
I'M TELLIN' YOU.

00:02:50.650 --> 00:02:53.479
AH, RIGHT, THEN.

00:02:53.523 --> 00:02:55.873
HMM. RIGHT.

00:02:55.916 --> 00:02:59.267
OK...GRYFFINDOR!

00:02:59.311 --> 00:03:01.531
[CHEERING]

00:03:08.146 --> 00:03:10.148
DRACO MALFOY.

00:03:15.545 --> 00:03:16.763
SLYTHERIN!

00:03:16.807 --> 00:03:18.635
[CHEERING]

00:03:18.678 --> 00:03:19.897
THERE'S NOT A WITCH

00:03:19.940 --> 00:03:20.898
OR WIZARD
WHO WENT BAD

00:03:20.941 --> 00:03:21.986
WHO WASN'T
IN SLYTHERIN.

00:03:22.029 --> 00:03:23.379
SUSAN BONES.

00:03:31.474 --> 00:03:33.214
AHH!

00:03:33.258 --> 00:03:34.738
HARRY!
WHAT IS IT?

00:03:34.781 --> 00:03:36.870
NOTHING.

00:03:36.914 --> 00:03:38.437
NOTHING.
I'M FINE.

00:03:38.481 --> 00:03:40.178
Sorting Hat:
LET'S SEE.

00:03:40.221 --> 00:03:43.399
I KNOW...
HUFFLEPUFF!

00:03:43.442 --> 00:03:46.227
[CHEERING]

00:03:46.271 --> 00:03:48.273
Professor McGonagall:
RONALD WEASLEY.

00:04:01.634 --> 00:04:04.768
HA! ANOTHER WEASLEY.

00:04:04.811 --> 00:04:07.727
I KNOW JUST WHAT
TO DO WITH YOU.

00:04:07.771 --> 00:04:09.686
GRYFFINDOR!

00:04:09.729 --> 00:04:12.950
[CHEERING]

00:04:16.693 --> 00:04:18.651
HARRY POTTER.

00:04:36.234 --> 00:04:37.278
HMM.

00:04:37.322 --> 00:04:40.499
DIFFICULT,
VERY DIFFICULT.

00:04:40.543 --> 00:04:42.719
PLENTY OF COURAGE,
I SEE.

00:04:42.762 --> 00:04:44.764
NOT A BAD MIND,
EITHER.

00:04:44.808 --> 00:04:47.158
THERE'S TALENT--
OH, YES--

00:04:47.201 --> 00:04:50.553
AND A THIRST
TO PROVE YOURSELF.

00:04:50.596 --> 00:04:53.512
BUT WHERE TO PUT YOU?

00:04:53.556 --> 00:04:55.514
[WHISPERING]
Not Slytherin.

00:04:55.558 --> 00:04:56.646
Not Slytherin.

00:04:56.689 --> 00:04:58.865
NOT SLYTHERIN, EH?

00:04:58.909 --> 00:05:00.519
ARE YOU SURE?

00:05:00.563 --> 00:05:02.173
YOU COULD BE GREAT,
YOU KNOW.

00:05:02.216 --> 00:05:05.655
IT'S ALL HERE
IN YOUR HEAD.

00:05:05.698 --> 00:05:07.526
AND SLYTHERIN
WILL HELP YOU

00:05:07.570 --> 00:05:09.485
ON THE WAY
TO GREATNESS,

00:05:09.528 --> 00:05:11.399
THERE'S NO DOUBT
ABOUT THAT.

00:05:11.443 --> 00:05:12.444
NO?

00:05:12.488 --> 00:05:13.445
No, please,
please...

00:05:13.489 --> 00:05:15.578
WELL, IF YOU'RE SURE...

00:05:15.621 --> 00:05:16.579
...anything
but Slytherin...

00:05:16.622 --> 00:05:20.191
BETTER BE...GRYFFINDOR!

00:05:20.234 --> 00:05:22.236
[CHEERING]

00:05:44.432 --> 00:05:45.651
[DINGING]

00:05:45.695 --> 00:05:47.348
YOUR ATTENTION,
PLEASE.

00:05:50.482 --> 00:05:53.224
LET THE FEAST BEGIN.

00:05:54.355 --> 00:05:56.488
[STUDENTS CHATTERING]

00:05:57.968 --> 00:05:59.143
WOW.

00:06:09.719 --> 00:06:11.416
I'M HALF AND HALF.

00:06:11.459 --> 00:06:13.287
ME DAD'S A MUGGLE.

00:06:13.331 --> 00:06:14.593
MUM'S A WITCH.

00:06:14.637 --> 00:06:16.595
BIT OF A NASTY SHOCK
FOR HIM

00:06:16.639 --> 00:06:17.814
WHEN HE FOUND OUT.

00:06:19.511 --> 00:06:22.470
SAY, PERCY,
WHO'S THAT TEACHER

00:06:22.514 --> 00:06:23.602
TALKING TO
PROFESSOR QUIRRELL?

00:06:23.646 --> 00:06:25.299
Percy: OH, THAT'S
PROFESSOR SNAPE,

00:06:25.343 --> 00:06:27.127
HEAD
OF SLYTHERIN HOUSE.

00:06:27.171 --> 00:06:28.172
WHAT'S HE TEACH?

00:06:28.215 --> 00:06:29.173
POTIONS.

00:06:29.216 --> 00:06:30.217
BUT EVERYONE KNOWS

00:06:30.261 --> 00:06:31.436
IT'S THE DARK ARTS
HE FANCIES.

00:06:31.479 --> 00:06:32.611
HE'S BEEN AFTER
QUIRRELL'S JOB

00:06:32.655 --> 00:06:33.873
FOR YEARS.

00:06:39.009 --> 00:06:40.967
AAH!
HELLO!

00:06:41.011 --> 00:06:41.968
HOW ARE YOU?

00:06:42.012 --> 00:06:44.318
WELCOME
TO GRYFFINDOR.

00:06:44.362 --> 00:06:46.494
[WIND BLOWING]

00:06:48.409 --> 00:06:49.933
[LAUGHTER]

00:06:51.021 --> 00:06:53.676
WHOO-HOO-HOO!
WHOO-HOO!

00:06:55.634 --> 00:06:56.983
Girl: LOOK, IT'S
THE BLOODY BARON!

00:06:57.027 --> 00:06:58.985
[LAUGHING]

00:07:02.728 --> 00:07:04.904
HELLO, SIR NICHOLAS.
HAVE A NICE SUMMER?

00:07:04.948 --> 00:07:06.645
DISMAL.

00:07:06.689 --> 00:07:08.168
ONCE AGAIN,
MY REQUEST TO JOIN

00:07:08.212 --> 00:07:11.258
THE HEADLESS HUNT
HAS BEEN DENIED.

00:07:13.826 --> 00:07:15.393
I KNOW YOU!

00:07:15.436 --> 00:07:17.264
YOU'RE NEARLY HEADLESS NICK!

00:07:17.308 --> 00:07:20.224
I PREFER SIR NICHOLAS,
IF YOU DON'T MIND.

00:07:20.267 --> 00:07:21.878
NEARLY HEADLESS?

00:07:21.921 --> 00:07:23.880
HOW CAN YOU BE
NEARLY HEADLESS?

00:07:23.923 --> 00:07:25.272
LIKE THIS.

00:07:26.926 --> 00:07:28.188
AAH!

00:07:35.979 --> 00:07:37.049
Percy: GRYFFINDORS,
FOLLOW ME, PLEASE.

